hadiths[46]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1465","Noman bin Basheer (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dua hi ibaadat hai."
"1466","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jaame duaon ko pasand farmatey they aur uskey siwa ko chhor detey they. Ise Abu Dawud ne jayyad sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1467","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aksar dua thi: Ae Allah! Hamein duniya mein bhalai ata farma aur aakhirat mein bhalai ata farma, aur hamein dozakh key azaab se bacha. (Muttafaqun aleh). Muslim ne apni riwayat mein izafa kya hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aur Anas jab koi dua maangna chahtey to isi se dua maangtey, aur jab koi dua maangna chahtey to us mein isi se dua maangtey."
"1468","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they: Ae Allah! Beshak main Tujh se hidayat aur taqwa aur paakdaamani aur be-niyaazi ka sawal karta hun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1469","Taariq bin Ashyam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab koi aadmi Musalman hota to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey namaz sikhaatey, phir usey hukm detey ke in kalimaat key sath dua maangey: Ae Allah! Mujhey bakhsh dey aur mujh par rehem farma aur mujhey hidayat dey aur mujhey aafiyat ata farma aur mujhey rizq ata farma. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai Taariq se ke unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko suna jabke Aap key paas aik aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main kaisey kahun jab apne Rab se maangun? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Mujhey bakhsh dey aur mujh par rehem farma aur mujhey aafiyat ata farma aur mujhey rizq ata farma, kyonke ye tumharey liye tumhari duniya aur aakhirat ko jama kartey hain."
"1470","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Dilon ko pherne waley! Hamarey dilon ko apni itaat par pher dey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1471","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki panah maango aazmaaish ki sakhti se, aur badbakhti key paaney se, aur burey faisley se, aur dushmanon key khush honay se. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Sufyan ne kaha: Mujhey shak hai ke main ne un mein se aik ka izafa kya hai."
"1472","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they: Ae Allah! Merey liye mera deen durust farma jo merey muamley ki hifaazat hai, aur merey liye meri duniya durust farma jis mein meri maeeshat hai, aur merey liye meri aakhirat durust farma jis mein mera laut-na hai, aur zindagi ko merey liye har bhalai mein izafa bana, aur maut ko merey liye har shar se raahat bana. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1473","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Mujhey hidayat dey aur mujhey seedha rakh. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Ae Allah! Beshak main Tujh se hidayat aur durustagi ka sawal karta hun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1474","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah maangta hun aajizi aur susti aur buzdili aur budhaapey aur kanjoosi se, aur Teri panah maangta hun qabr key azaab se, aur Teri panah maangta hun zindagi aur maut key fitney se. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Aur qarz key bojh se aur aadmiyon key ghalib aaney se. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1475","Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Mujhey aisi dua sikhaein jo main apni namaz mein maangun. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Beshak main ne apni jaan par bahut zulm kya, aur gunah Terey siwa koi nahi bakhshta, isliye mujhey apne paas se maghfirat ata farma aur mujh par rehem farma. Beshak Tu hi bakhshney wala rehem wala hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Aur merey ghar mein. Aur riwayat kya gaya: Bahut zulm, aur riwayat kya gaya: Bara, saalisa key sath aur muwahhada key sath, isliye donon ko jama karna chahiye aur kahey: Bahut bara."
"1476","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap is dua key sath dua maangtey they: Ae Allah! Meri khata aur meri jihaalat bakhsh dey, aur merey muamley mein meri hadd se tajawuz, aur jo Tu mujh se zyada jaanne wala hai. Ae Allah! Meri sanjeedagi aur meri hansi bakhsh dey, aur meri khata aur mera jaan boojh kar karna, aur ye sab merey paas hain. Ae Allah! Jo main ne aagey bheja aur jo peechey kya bakhsh dey, aur jo chhupaya aur jo zaahir kya, aur jo Tu mujh se zyada jaanne wala hai. Tu hi aagey karne wala hai aur Tu hi peechey karne wala hai, aur Tu har chiz par qaadir hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1477","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni dua mein kehtey they: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah maangta hun us shar se jo main ne kya aur us shar se jo main ne nahi kya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1478","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dua mein se tha: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah maangta hun Teri naimat key zawaal se, aur Teri aafiyat key badalney se, aur Teri naagahaani pakad se, aur Teri tamaam naraazgi se. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1479","Zaid bin Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah maangta hun aajizi aur susti aur kanjoosi aur budhaapey aur qabr key azaab se. Ae Allah! Merey nafs ko uska taqwa ata farma aur usey paak farma, Tu usey paak karne walon mein sab se behtar hai, Tu uska dost aur maalik hai. Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah maangta hun aise ilm se jo faeda na dey, aur aise dil se jo na darey, aur aise nafs se jo sair na ho, aur aisi dua se jo qabool na ki jaey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1480","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they: Ae Allah! Terey liye main ne Islam qabool kya, aur Tujh par imaan laya, aur Tujh par bharosa kya, aur Teri taraf rujoo kya, aur Terey sath jhagda kya, aur Terey paas faisla ley gaya. Isliye mujhey bakhsh dey jo main ne aagey bheja aur jo peechey kya, aur jo chhupaya aur jo zaahir kya. Tu hi aagey karne wala hai aur Tu hi peechey karne wala hai, Terey siwa koi mabood nahi. Baaz ruwat ne izafa kya hai: Aur na koi taqat aur na koi quwwat magar Allah ki taufeeq se. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1481","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) in kalimaat key sath dua maangtey they: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah maangta hun dozakh key fitney se, aur dozakh key azaab se, aur dolat aur faqr key shar se. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai, aur ye Abu Dawud ka lafz hai."
"1482","Ziyaad bin Ilaaqa se apne chacha, aur wo Qutba bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) hain, se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah maangta hun akhlaaq aur aamaal aur khuwahishaat ki buraaiyon se. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1483","Shakal bin Humaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhey dua sikhaein. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah maangta hun apne kaan key shar se, aur apni aankh key shar se, aur apni zabaan key shar se, aur apne dil key shar se, aur apne nutfey key shar se. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1484","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah maangta hun bars aur deewangi aur kodh aur buri beemariyon se. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1485","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah maangta hun bhook se, kyonke wo bura humnasheen hai, aur Teri panah maangta hun khayaanat se, kyonke wo bura baatin hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1486","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik mukaatib unkey paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Beshak main apni kitaabat se aajiz ho gaya hun, isliye meri madad karo. Unhon-ne kaha: Kya main tumhey aise kalimey na sikhaun jo mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sikhaey they, agar tum par pahaad key barabar qarz ho to Allah tumhari taraf se ada kar dey? Kaho: Ae Allah! Mujhey apne halaal key sath apne haraam se bacha aur mujhey apne fazl key sath apne siwa se be-niyaaz farma. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1487","Imran bin Husain (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unkey walid Husain ko do kalimey sikhaey jin key sath wo dua maangey: Ae Allah! Mujhey meri bhalai ilhaam farma aur mujhey apne nafs key shar se panah dey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1488","Abul Fazl Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhey aisi chiz sikhaein jo main Allah Taala se maangun. Aap ne farmaya: Allah se aafiyat maango. To main chand din thehra, phir aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhey aisi chiz sikhaein jo main Allah Taala se maangun. Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Abbas! Ae Rasulullah key chacha! Allah se duniya aur aakhirat mein aafiyat maango. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1489","Shahr bin Haushab se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Umm Salama (Raziallahu anha) se kaha: Ae Ummul Momineen! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aksar dua kya thi jab wo tumharey paas hotey? Unhon-ne kaha: Aap ki aksar dua thi: Ae dilon ko pherne waley! Merey dil ko apne deen par saabit rakh. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1490","Abud Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dawood (Alehis salaam) ki dua mein se tha: Ae Allah! Beshak main Tujh se Teri mohabbat ka sawal karta hun, aur uski mohabbat ka jo Tujh se mohabbat karta hai, aur us amal ka jo mujhey Teri mohabbat tak pahunchaye. Ae Allah! Apni mohabbat ko merey liye meri jaan aur merey ghar walon aur thandey paani se zyada mehboob bana. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1491","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ya Zaljalaali wal Ikraam ko laazim pakdo. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai, aur Nasaai ne Rabee'a bin Aamir Sahaabi ki riwayat se naql kya hai. Haakim ne kaha: Sahih sanad hadis hai."
"1492","Abu Umama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bahut si dua maangi jis mein se ham ne kuchh yaad na kya. Ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tum ne bahut si dua maangi jis mein se ham ne kuchh yaad na kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya main tumhey uski taraf rahnumai na karun jo us sab ko jama karey? Tum kaho: Ae Allah! Beshak main Tujh se us bhalai ka sawal karta hun jo Tujh se Terey Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne maangi, aur Teri panah maangta hun us shar se jis se Terey Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne panah maangi. Aur Tu hi madadgaar hai aur Tujh par pahunchana hai, aur na koi taqat aur na koi quwwat magar Allah ki taufeeq se. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1493","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dua mein se tha: Ae Allah! Beshak main Tujh se Teri rehmat key laazim karne waley kaamon ka sawal karta hun, aur Teri maghfirat key pukhta faislon ka, aur har gunah se salaamti ka, aur har neki se ghanimat ka, aur Jannat mein kamyaabi ka, aur dozakh se nijaat ka. Ise Haakim Abu Abdullah ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Muslim ki shart par sahih hadis hai."
"1494","Abud Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo Musalman banda apne bhai key liye peeth peechey dua maangta hai to farishta kehta hai: Aur terey liye bhi waisa ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1495","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they: Musalman aadmi ki apne bhai key liye peeth peechey dua maqbool hai, uskey sar key paas muakkal farishta hai, jab kabhi wo apne bhai key liye bhalai ki dua maangta hai to muakkal farishta kehta hai: Aameen, aur terey liye bhi waisa ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1496","Usama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis key sath bhalai ki gaei phir us ne karne waley se kaha: Allah tumhey bhalai ka badla dey, to us ne sana mein mubaalgha kya. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1497","Jabir (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne oopar baddua na karo, aur apni aulaad par baddua na karo, aur apne maalon par baddua na karo. Allah ki taraf se aisi ghadi na pao jis mein ata maanga jata hai aur wo tumharey liye qabool kar ley. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1498","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Banda apne Rab se sab se zyada qareeb hota hai jab wo sajdey mein hota hai, isliye kasrat se dua karo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1499","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se har aik ki dua qabool ki jaati hai jab tak jaldi na karey: Kehta hai: Main ne apne Rab se dua maangi aur us ne meri dua qabool na ki. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Banda ki dua hamesha qabool ki jaati hai jab tak wo gunah ya qata rehmi ki dua na maangey, jab tak jaldi na karey. Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Jaldi kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kehta hai: Main ne dua maangi aur main ne dua maangi aur main ne na dekha ke meri dua qabool ki gaei. To us waqt thak haar kar dua chhor deta hai."
"1500","Abu Umama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha gaya: Kaun si dua zyada sunney wali hai? Aap ne farmaya: Raat key aakhri hissey mein aur farz namazon key peechey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1501","Ubaada bin As-Saamit (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zameen par jo Musalman Allah Taala se koi dua maangta hai to Allah usey wahi deta hai ya us se us jaisa shar pher deta hai, jab tak wo gunah ya qata rehmi ki dua na maangey. To qaum mein se aik aadmi ne kaha: Tab to ham kasrat kareingey. Aap ne farmaya: Allah zyada dene wala hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1502","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) takleef key waqt kehtey they: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi jo azeem burdbaar hai. Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi jo Arsh-e-Azeem ka Rab hai. Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi jo aasmaanon aur zameen ka Rab hai aur Arsh-e-Kareem ka Rab hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1503","Abu Muhammad Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakr Siddiq (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Ashaab-e-Suffa faqr waaley log they, aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik martaba farmaya: Jiskey paas do ka khaana ho wo teesrey ko ley jaey, aur jiskey paas chaar ka khaana ho wo paanchwein ya chhatey ko ley jaey, ya jaisa Aap ne farmaya. Aur Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) teen ko laey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) das ko ley gaey. Aur Abu Bakr ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas raat ka khaana khaaya phir thehrey yahan tak ke Isha padhi, phir wapas aey aur raat mein se jitna Allah ne chaaha guzarney key baad aey. To unki biwi ne un se kaha: Tumhey tumharey mehmaanon se kis ne rok diya? Unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum ne unhey raat ka khaana nahi khilaya? Unhon-ne kaha: Unhon-ne inkaar kya yahan tak ke tum aao, aur unhon-ne un par pesh kya tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To main gaya aur chhup gaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae ghusar! To bura kaha aur gaali di, aur kaha: Khao, tumhey mubaarak na ho. Allah ki qasam! Main usey kabhi nahi khaunga. Unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Ham jis luqmey ko letey they to uskey neechey se us se zyada badhta tha yahan tak ke wo sair ho gaey, aur wo us se zyada ho gaya jo us se pehley tha. To Abu Bakr ne uski taraf dekha aur apni biwi se kaha: Ae Bani Firaas ki behan! Ye kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Meri aankh ki thandak ki qasam! Wo ab us se teen guna zyada hai jo us se pehley thi! To Abu Bakr ne us mein se khaaya aur kaha: Ye to shaitaan ki taraf se tha, yaani apni qasam. Phir us mein se aik luqma khaaya, phir usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf uthakar ley gaey aur wo subah Aap key paas tha. Aur hamarey aur aik qaum key darmiyaan ahd tha, phir muddat guzar gai aur ham baarah aadmi muntashir huey, un mein se har aadmi key sath log they, Allah behtar jaanta hai har aadmi key sath kitney, to un sab ne us mein se khaaya. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: To Abu Bakr ne qasam khai ke wo nahi khaayega, to aurat ne qasam khai ke wo nahi khaayegi, to mehmaan, ya mehmaanon ne qasam khai ke wo nahi khaayega, ya nahi khaayengey yahan tak ke wo khaey. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Ye shaitaan ki taraf se hai! To khaana maanga aur khaaya aur unhon-ne khaaya. To wo jis luqmey ko uthatey they to uskey neechey se us se zyada badhta tha. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae Bani Firaas ki behan! Ye kya hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Meri aankh ki thandak ki qasam! Beshak wo ab khaaney se pehley se zyada hai. To unhon-ne khaaya aur usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf bheja aur zikr kya ke Aap ne us mein se khaaya. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Beshak Abu Bakr ne Abdur Rahman se kaha: Apne mehmaanon ko ley lo, kyonke main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf jaaney wala hun, isliye merey aaney se pehley unki mehmaan nawaazi se farigh hojao. To Abdur Rahman gaya aur unkey paas jo tha wo laaya aur kaha: Khao. To unhon-ne kaha: Hamarey ghar ka maalik kahaan hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Khao. Unhon-ne kaha: Ham nahi khaayengey yahan tak ke hamarey ghar ka maalik aey. Unhon-ne kaha: Hamari taraf se apni mehmaan nawaazi qabool karo, kyonke agar wo aaya aur tum ne na khaaya to ham us se museebat paayengey. To unhon-ne inkaar kya. To main ne pehchaana ke wo mujh par naraaz hain. Phir jab wo aey to main un se door hata. To unhon-ne kaha: Tum ne kya kya? To unhon-ne unhey khabar di. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae Abdur Rahman! To main khamosh raha. Phir kaha: Ae Abdur Rahman! To main khamosh raha. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae ghusar! Main tumhey qasam deta hun agar tum meri awaz suntey ho to aao! To main nikla aur kaha: Apne mehmaanon se poochho. To unhon-ne kaha: Us ne sach kaha, wo hamarey paas laaya tha. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main ne tumhara intizaar kya. Phir khaana laaya gaya aur khaaya aur unhon-ne khaaya. Phir subah Abu Bakr Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas gaey aur farmaya: Ae Allah key Rasool! Qasam poori ho gai aur neki ho gai, kya ye raat meri thi ya pehli? Aap ne farmaya: Balke pehli raat. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1504","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum se pehli ummaton mein aise log they jinhey ilhaam kya jata tha, phir agar meri ummat mein koi hai to wo Umar hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai, aur Muslim ne Aaisha ki riwayat se naql kya hai, aur un donon ki riwayat mein Ibn Wahb ne kaha: Muhaddasoon yaani ilhaam kiye gaey."
"1505","Jabir bin Samura (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ahle Kufa ne Saad, yaani Ibn Abi Waqqas (Raziallahu anhu), ki Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se shikayat ki to unhon-ne unhey mazool kar diya aur un par Ammaar ko aamil banaya. To unhon-ne shikayat ki yahan tak ke unhon-ne zikr kya ke wo achchhi tarah namaz nahi padhtey. To unhon-ne unki taraf paighaam bheja aur farmaya: Ae Abu Ishaaq! Beshak ye gumaan kartey hain ke tum achchhi tarah namaz nahi padhtey. To unhon-ne kaha: Raha main, Allah ki qasam! Beshak main unhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki namaz padhata tha, us se kami nahi karta tha. Isha ki namaz padhata tha aur pehli do mein theher-ta tha aur aakhri do mein halki karta tha. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae Abu Ishaaq! Tumharey sath yehi gumaan hai. Aur unkey sath aik aadmi, ya aadmi, Kufa ki taraf bheja jo Ahle Kufa se unkey baarey mein poochhey. To us ne koi masjid na chhori magar uskey baarey mein poochha aur wo bhalai ki sana kartey. Yahan tak ke Bani Abs ki aik masjid mein dakhil hua to un mein se aik aadmi khada hua jisey Usaama bin Qatada kaha jata hai, uski kuniyat Abu Saada hai. To us ne kaha: Raha jab tum ne hamein qasam di hai to Saad na chhote lashkar key sath chalta tha aur na barabar taqseem karta tha aur na muqadmey mein insaaf karta tha. Saad ne kaha: Khabardaar! Allah ki qasam! Main teen duaen karunga: Ae Allah! Agar Tera ye banda jhoota hai, riya aur shauhrat key liye khada hua tha, to uski umr lambi farma, aur uska faqr lamba farma, aur usey fitnon mein daal. Aur uskey baad jab us se poochha jata to kehta: Boodha fitney mein mubtala, mujhey Saad ki baddua lagi hai. Rawi Jabir bin Samura se Abdul Maalik bin Umair ne kaha: To main ne usey uskey baad dekha jab uski bhanwein budhaapey se uski aankhon par gir gai thein, aur wo raaston mein londiyon ko chhedta tha aur unhey ishara karta tha. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1506","Urwa bin Az-Zubair se riwayat hai ke Saeed bin Zaid bin Amr bin Nufail (Raziallahu anhu) se Arwa bint Aus ne Marwaan bin Al-Hakam key paas jhagda kya aur daawa kya ke us ne uski zameen mein se kuchh liya hai. To Saeed ne kaha: Kya main uski zameen mein se kuchh lunga uskey baad jo main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai!? Us ne kaha: Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya suna hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo shakhs baalisht bhar zameen zulm se ley to usey saat zameenon tak tauq pehnaya jaeyga. To Marwaan ne us se kaha: Main tum se iskey baad daleel nahi maangunga. To Saeed ne kaha: Ae Allah! Agar wo jhooti hai to uski beenai zaaya farma aur usey uski zameen mein qatl farma. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo na mari yahan tak ke uski beenai zaaya ho gai, aur aik martaba wo apni zameen mein chal rahi thi ke garhey mein gir gai aur mar gai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein Muhammad bin Zaid bin Abdullah bin Umar se isi maana mein hai aur wo usey andhi deewarein taalaash karti dekhta tha aur kehti thi: Mujhey Saeed ki baddua lagi hai, aur wo us ghar key kuen par guzri jis mein us ne us se jhagda kya tha aur us mein gir gai aur wahi uski qabr thi."
"1507","Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Uhad haazir hui to merey walid ne mujhey raat mein bulaya aur kaha: Main apne aap ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba mein sab se pehley qatl honay walon mein qatl hua hi dekhta hun, aur beshak main apne peechey tum se zyada azeez kisi ko nahi chhorta siwaey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zaat key, aur beshak mujh par qarz hai to ada karna, aur apni behnon key sath bhalai ki waseeyat karna. To ham ne subah ki aur wo sab se pehley qatl huey, aur unkey sath aik aur dafan kya gaya unki qabr mein. Phir mera dil na chaaha ke main usey aik aur key sath chhorun, to main ne usey chhey maah baad nikaala, to wo aisa tha jaisa main ne usey rakha tha siwaey uskey kaan key. To main ne usey alag qabr mein rakha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1508","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba mein se do aadmi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas se andheri raat mein nikley jabke un donon key saamney do chiraaghon ki tarah tha. Phir jab wo judaa huey to har aik key sath aik ho gaya yahan tak ke wo apne ghar aaya. Ise Bukhari ne kai tareeqon se riwayat kya hai, aur baaz mein hai ke wo do aadmi Usaid bin Hudhair aur Abbaad bin Bishr (Raziallahu anhuma) they."
"1509","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne das sahaaba ka aik khufiya lashkar bheja aur un par Aasim bin Saabit Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) ko ameer banaya. To wo chaley yahan tak ke jab wo Hadah mein they jo Usfaan aur Makkah key darmiyaan hai, to Huzail key aik qabeeley ka zikr kya gaya jinhey Banu Lahyaan kaha jata hai. To wo taqreeban sau teer andaaz aadmiyon key sath unki taraf nikley aur unkey nishaanon ka peecha kya. Phir jab Aasim aur unkey saathiyon ne unhey mehsoos kya to wo aik jagah panah gaey aur qaum ne unhey gher liya. To unhon-ne kaha: Utro aur apne haath do, aur tumharey liye ahd aur misaaq hai ke ham tum mein se kisi ko qatl nahi kareingey. To Aasim bin Saabit ne kaha: Ae qaum! Raha main, to main kaafir key zimma par na utrunga. Ae Allah! Hamari taraf se apne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khabar dey. To unhon-ne un par teer barsaey aur Aasim ko qatl kar diya. Aur teen aadmi ahd aur misaaq par unkey paas utrey, un mein Khubaib aur Zaid bin Ad-Disina aur aik aur aadmi they. Phir jab wo un par qaabu paa gaey to unhon-ne apni kamanon key taant kholey aur unhey un se baandha. To teesre aadmi ne kaha: Ye pehli dhoka hai, Allah ki qasam! Main tumhara sath nahi dunga, beshak merey liye in mein uswa hai, yaani qatl honay walon mein. To unhon-ne usey ghaseeta aur us se kushti ki, to us ne unka sath dene se inkaar kya aur unhon-ne usey qatl kar diya. Aur Khubaib aur Zaid bin Ad-Disina ko ley gaey yahan tak ke unhey Ghazwa Badr key baad Makkah mein baich diya. To Banu Al-Haaris bin Aamir bin Naufal bin Abd Manaaf ne Khubaib ko khareeda, aur Khubaib ne Badr key din Al-Haaris ko qatl kya tha. To Khubaib unkey paas qaidi raha yahan tak ke unhon-ne uskey qatl par ijmaa kya. To us ne Banu Al-Haaris ki baaz betiyon se istinja key liye ustra udhaar maanga aur unhon-ne udhaar diya. To uska aik ladka ghafil haalat mein rengta hua uskey paas aaya, to us ne usey apni raan par bithaya hua paaya jabke ustra uskey haath mein tha. To wo aisi ghabrahat se ghabrai jo Khubaib ne pehchaani. To us ne kaha: Kya tum darti ho ke main usey qatl kar dunga? Main aisa karne wala na tha. Us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main ne Khubaib se behtar qaidi nahi dekha. Allah ki qasam! Main ne usey aik din dekha ke wo apne haath mein angoor ka khosha kha raha tha jabke wo lohey mein jakda hua tha aur Makkah mein koi phal na tha. Aur wo kehti thi: Beshak wo rizq hai jo Allah ne Khubaib ko diya tha. Phir jab wo usey Haram se Hal key liye qatl karne nikley to Khubaib ne un se kaha: Mujhey do rakaatein padhney do. To unhon-ne usey chhor diya aur us ne do rakaatein padhein. To us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Agar tum gumaan na kartey ke mujh mein ghabrahat hai to main zyada padhta. Ae Allah! Unhey ginti mein shumaar farma, aur unhey tukdey tukdey karke qatl farma, aur un mein se kisi ko na chhor. Aur us ne kaha: Mujhey parwah nahi jab main Musalman hokar qatl kya jaun, Allah key liye mera giRNa kis pehlu par ho. Aur ye Allah ki zaat mein hai, aur agar wo chaahey to tukdey tukdey jism key joron par barkat ata farmaye. Aur Khubaib ne har Musalman key liye jo sabr se qatl kya jaey namaz ki sunnat jaari ki. Aur Aap, yaani Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam), ne apne sahaaba ko us din khabar di jis din wo museebat mein mubtala huey. Aur Quraish mein se kuchh logon ne Aasim bin Saabit ki taraf bheja jab unhey khabar di gai ke wo qatl ho gaey hain ke unkey paas us mein se kuchh laaya jaey jis se wo pehchaaney jaein, aur us ne unkey bade aadmiyon mein se aik ko qatl kya tha. To Allah ne Aasim key liye shahad ki makhiyon ka saaybaan bheja aur unhey unkey qaasidon se bacha liya, to wo us mein se kuchh kaat-ney par qaadir na huey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Uska qaul Hadah waghera mashhoor lughat ki kitaabon mein hai."
"1510","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko kisi chiz key liye ye kehtey huey nahi suna: Beshak main usey is tarah gumaan karta hun magar wo waisa hota tha jaisa wo gumaan kartey they. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
